      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Lambedor. Se a saliva pegajosa de Lickitung cair sobre alguém e não for removida, provoca uma coceira intensa que não desaparece. Pokémon inseto são sua principal fonte de alimento. Ele paralisa as presas com uma lambida de sua longa língua e depois as engole inteiras.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 7 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Lickitung pode evoluir para Lickilicky no momento em que aprende o Move 'Rollout'. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Lick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Supersonic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Defense Curl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Wrap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Stomp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Disable</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Rollout</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Chip Away</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Me First</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Refresh, Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Belly Drum, Power Whip, Wring Out</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aqua Tail, Attract, Bind, Blizzard, Brick Break, Brutal Swing, Bulldoze, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Dragon Tail, Dream Eater, Earthquake, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Punch, Flamethrower, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Impact, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Ice Ball, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Round, Sandstorm, Screech, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Steel Roller, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Surf, Swagger, Swords Dance, Terrain Pulse, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Water Pulse, Whirlpool, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Belch, Belly Drum, Body Slam, Curse, Hammer Arm, Magnitude, Muddy Water, Sleep Talk, Smelling Salts, Snore, Thrash, Zen Headbutt</p>",
